  "description": {
   "en": "Pleasure corruption via indecent muscles!? Me? No way!\nWhen Akane returns home, Okada, the Tsugaru dialect speaking university student who lives next door is always waiting for her due to having \"forgotten\" the key to his apartment.\nIt all started from a mere coincidence... At first she took pity on him and let him stay at her place...\nBut over time, the frequency of his visits have increased... and so too, the boldness of his requests!\n\n\"You Love My Muscles (THIS), Right?\"\nEven in the presence of his gorgeous sculpture like muscles, she had somehow managed to resist the urge to stay in control of her senses... (Past Tense.)\n\n\"Akane, I earnestly want to have sex with you.\" !!?\nIf his mountain range like ripples weren't enough, the explosively direct request he makes was sure to push her over the edge.\n\nOkada, self-centered and cute, but more erotic and cool than anyone she knows...\nBut Akane isn't aware that Okada has a \"certain something\" he has been keeping secret...?"
  },
